					<functionBlock name="AHUTempCntrlStrategy" version="1.1.0" creationDate="0" lastModifiedDate="1716197184">
						<title>Temperature Control Strategy for AHU</title>
						<descr>&lt;HTML&gt;The AHU temperature control strategy function block is a control strategy function block. This function block controls 
the discharge air temperature of an air handling unit by modulating heating, cooling, dampers and air flow.  
The module must be used in together with the AHU plant strategy module. 
The module supports constant discharge air temperature control and room/exhaust air compensated 
discharge air temperature control (master and slave control). 
The module supports summer and winter compensation to improve comfort and reduce energy consumption. 
In addition the build in economizer function will reduce energy consumption by comparing indoor and 
outdoor air temperatures. 
This module supports both chilled water cooling coils as well direct expansion valve (DX cooling).</descr>
						<vars>
							<inputVars>
								<var name="xEn" type="BOOL">
									<descr>TRUE: FB enabled, FALSE: FB disabled</descr>
								</var>
								<var name="iDischargeAirTemp" type="INT">
									<descr>Discharge Air Temperature (*0.1 °C/°F)</descr>
								</var>
								<var name="iReturnAirTemp" type="INT">
									<descr>Return Air Temperature (*0.1 °C/°F)</descr>
								</var>
								<var name="iOutdoorAirTemp" type="INT">
									<descr>Outdoor Air Temperature (*0.1 °C/°F)</descr>
								</var>
								<var name="iSetp" type="INT">
