					<functionBlock name="CompCntrl_VS" version="1.1.5" creationDate="0" lastModifiedDate="1716460913">
						<title>Compressor Control Variable Speed</title>
						<descr>&lt;HTML&gt;The CompCntrl_VS function block controls 1 scroll, screw or reciprocating compressor through variable speed drive in order to control compressor capacity.&lt;br&gt;
NOTE: This function block must be used together with the function block CompAlarmMgmt to help prevent damages of the compressor.&lt;br&gt;

&lt;div class= section  id= D-SE-0046198__D-SE-0046198.18 &gt;
&lt;a name= D-SE-0046198.18  id= D-SE-0046198.18 &gt;
&lt;!-- --&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a name= D_SE_0046198_18  id= D_SE_0046198_18 &gt;
&lt;!-- --&gt;&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;h2 class= title sectiontitle &gt;
&lt;span class= keyword parmname &gt;udiCompMgmtStatus&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class= div &gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
&lt;strong class= ph b &gt;Bit 0-23&lt;/strong&gt; operating hours ( maximum 16.777.216 hours)
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
&lt;strong class= ph b &gt;Bit 24:&lt;/strong&gt; reserved
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
&lt;strong class= ph b &gt;Bit 25:&lt;/strong&gt; reserved
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
&lt;strong class= ph b &gt;Bit 26-27:&lt;/strong&gt; compressor mode 1 = auto, 2 = manual, 3 = maintenance
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
&lt;strong class= ph b &gt;Bit 28:&lt;/strong&gt; On timer active
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
&lt;strong class= ph b &gt;Bit 29:&lt;/strong&gt; Off timer active
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
&lt;strong class= ph b &gt;Bit 30:&lt;/strong&gt; Cycle timer active
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
&lt;strong class= ph b &gt;Bit 31:&lt;/strong&gt; Alarm
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
The following table details the compressor mode description for bit 26 and bit 27:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class= tablenoborder &gt;
&lt;table cellpadding= 4  cellspacing= 0  summary=   class= table  frame= border  border= 1  rules= all  style= max-width: 100% ;height: auto; &gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style= width:15.56340647080699%  /&gt;
&lt;col style= width:15.414652287095572%  /&gt;
&lt;col style= width:69.02194124209744%  /&gt;
&lt;/colgroup&gt;
&lt;thead class= thead  style= text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom; &gt;
&lt;tr class= row &gt;
&lt;th class= entry row-nocellborder  style= text-align:left;vertical-align:top;  id= d110982e1436 &gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
Bit 26
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class= entry row-nocellborder  style= text-align:left;vertical-align:top;  id= d110982e1440 &gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
Bit 27
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class= entry cellrowborder  style= text-align:left;vertical-align:top;  id= d110982e1444 &gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
Compressor mode description
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody class= tbody  style= vertical-align:top; &gt;
&lt;tr class= row &gt;
&lt;td class= entry row-nocellborder  style= text-align:left;vertical-align:top;  headers= d110982e1436  &gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
0
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class= entry row-nocellborder  style= text-align:left;vertical-align:top;  headers= d110982e1440  &gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
0
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class= entry cellrowborder  style= text-align:left;vertical-align:top;  headers= d110982e1444  &gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
Compressor FB disabled
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr class= row &gt;
&lt;td class= entry row-nocellborder  style= text-align:left;vertical-align:top;  headers= d110982e1436  &gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
0
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class= entry row-nocellborder  style= text-align:left;vertical-align:top;  headers= d110982e1440  &gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
1
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class= entry cellrowborder  style= text-align:left;vertical-align:top;  headers= d110982e1444  &gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
Auto
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr class= row &gt;
&lt;td class= entry row-nocellborder  style= text-align:left;vertical-align:top;  headers= d110982e1436  &gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
1
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class= entry row-nocellborder  style= text-align:left;vertical-align:top;  headers= d110982e1440  &gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
0
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class= entry cellrowborder  style= text-align:left;vertical-align:top;  headers= d110982e1444  &gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
Manual
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr class= row &gt;
&lt;td class= entry row-nocellborder  style= text-align:left;vertical-align:top;  headers= d110982e1436  &gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
1
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class= entry row-nocellborder  style= text-align:left;vertical-align:top;  headers= d110982e1440  &gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
1
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class= entry cellrowborder  style= text-align:left;vertical-align:top;  headers= d110982e1444  &gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
Maintenance
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class= section  id= D-SE-0046200__D-SE-0046200.15 &gt;
&lt;a name= D-SE-0046200.15  id= D-SE-0046200.15 &gt;
&lt;!-- --&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a name= D_SE_0046200_15  id= D_SE_0046200_15 &gt;
&lt;!-- --&gt;&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;h2 class= title sectiontitle &gt;
Normal Operation with &lt;span class= keyword parmname &gt;xCompCommand&lt;/span&gt; and &lt;span class= keyword parmname &gt;uiFreq&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
The output &lt;span class= keyword parmname &gt;xCompCommand&lt;/span&gt; enables the variable speed drive and &lt;span class= keyword parmname &gt;uiFreq&lt;/span&gt; is the frequency setpoint for the variable speed drive.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
The output &lt;span class= keyword parmname &gt;xCompCommand&lt;/span&gt; is controlled by the input &lt;span class= keyword parmname &gt;xCommand&lt;/span&gt;.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class= tablenoborder &gt;
&lt;table cellpadding= 4  cellspacing= 0  summary=   class= table  frame= border  border= 1  rules= all  style= max-width: 100% ;height: auto; &gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style= width:50%  /&gt;
&lt;col style= width:50%  /&gt;
&lt;/colgroup&gt;
&lt;thead class= thead  style= text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom; &gt;
&lt;tr class= row &gt;
&lt;th class= entry row-nocellborder  style= text-align:left;vertical-align:top;  id= d110982e1551 &gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
If...
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class= entry cellrowborder  style= text-align:left;vertical-align:top;  id= d110982e1555 &gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
Then...
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody class= tbody  style= vertical-align:top; &gt;
&lt;tr class= row &gt;
&lt;td class= entry row-nocellborder  style= text-align:left;vertical-align:top;  headers= d110982e1551  &gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
&lt;span class= keyword parmname &gt;xCommand&lt;/span&gt; is set to 1
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class= entry cellrowborder  style= text-align:left;vertical-align:top;  headers= d110982e1555  &gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
the output &lt;span class= keyword parmname &gt;xCompCommand&lt;/span&gt; is set to 1 and the variable speed drive frequency &lt;span class= keyword parmname &gt;uiFreq&lt;/span&gt; is controlled.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr class= row &gt;
&lt;td class= entry row-nocellborder  style= text-align:left;vertical-align:top;  headers= d110982e1551  &gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
&lt;span class= keyword parmname &gt;iSetp&lt;/span&gt; is lower than &lt;span class= keyword parmname &gt;iMinSetp&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class= entry cellrowborder  style= text-align:left;vertical-align:top;  headers= d110982e1555  &gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
the output &lt;span class= keyword parmname &gt;uiFreq&lt;/span&gt; is set to the minimum frequency &lt;span class= keyword parmname &gt;uiMinFreq&lt;/span&gt;.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr class= row &gt;
&lt;td class= entry row-nocellborder  style= text-align:left;vertical-align:top;  headers= d110982e1551  &gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
&lt;span class= keyword parmname &gt;xCommand&lt;/span&gt; is set to 0
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class= entry cellrowborder  style= text-align:left;vertical-align:top;  headers= d110982e1555  &gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
the output &lt;span class= keyword parmname &gt;xCompCommand&lt;/span&gt; is set to 0 and the variable speed drive frequency &lt;span class= keyword parmname &gt;uiFreq&lt;/span&gt; is set to 0.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class= note note &gt;
&lt;span class= notetitle &gt;NOTE:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class= keyword parmname &gt;iMinSetp&lt;/span&gt; must be lower than 100.0%.
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
To help avoid that the compressor is stopped and started too often, you can set the duration: &lt;span class= keyword parmname &gt;uiMinOnTime&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span class= keyword parmname &gt;uiMinOffTime&lt;/span&gt; and &lt;span class= keyword parmname &gt;uiMinCycleTime&lt;/span&gt;.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class= tablenoborder &gt;
&lt;table cellpadding= 4  cellspacing= 0  summary=   class= table  frame= border  border= 1  rules= all  style= max-width: 100% ;height: auto; &gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style= width:50%  /&gt;
&lt;col style= width:50%  /&gt;
&lt;/colgroup&gt;
&lt;thead class= thead  style= text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom; &gt;
&lt;tr class= row &gt;
&lt;th class= entry row-nocellborder  style= text-align:left;vertical-align:top;  id= d110982e1651 &gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
If...
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class= entry cellrowborder  style= text-align:left;vertical-align:top;  id= d110982e1655 &gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
Then...
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody class= tbody  style= vertical-align:top; &gt;
&lt;tr class= row &gt;
&lt;td class= entry row-nocellborder  style= text-align:left;vertical-align:top;  headers= d110982e1651  &gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
the timer &lt;span class= keyword parmname &gt;uiMinOffTime&lt;/span&gt; has not elapsed
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class= entry cellrowborder  style= text-align:left;vertical-align:top;  headers= d110982e1655  &gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
the compressor is not started.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr class= row &gt;
&lt;td class= entry row-nocellborder  style= text-align:left;vertical-align:top;  headers= d110982e1651  &gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
the time duration during 2 starts of the compressor is lower than &lt;span class= keyword parmname &gt;uiMinCycleTime&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class= entry cellrowborder  style= text-align:left;vertical-align:top;  headers= d110982e1655  &gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
the compressor is not started.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr class= row &gt;
&lt;td class= entry row-nocellborder  style= text-align:left;vertical-align:top;  headers= d110982e1651  &gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
the compressor has the order to stop and the &lt;span class= keyword parmname &gt;uiMinOnTime&lt;/span&gt; has not elapsed
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class= entry cellrowborder  style= text-align:left;vertical-align:top;  headers= d110982e1655  &gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
&lt;span class= keyword parmname &gt;uiFreq&lt;/span&gt; is set to &lt;span class= keyword parmname &gt;uiMinFreq&lt;/span&gt;.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class= section  id= D-SE-0046200__D-SE-0046200.10 &gt;
&lt;a name= D-SE-0046200.10  id= D-SE-0046200.10 &gt;
&lt;!-- --&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a name= D_SE_0046200_10  id= D_SE_0046200_10 &gt;
&lt;!-- --&gt;&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;h2 class= title sectiontitle &gt;
Alarm ID Description
&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
The &lt;span class= keyword parmname &gt;uiAlarmID&lt;/span&gt; output represents a value from 0 to 15, whereby each bit represents a detected alarm. The table contains the bits and their description:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class= tablenoborder &gt;
&lt;table cellpadding= 4  cellspacing= 0  summary=   class= table  frame= border  border= 1  rules= all  style= max-width: 100% ;height: auto; &gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style= width:13.255944579666728%  /&gt;
&lt;col style= width:56.91818011608313%  /&gt;
&lt;col style= width:29.82587530425014%  /&gt;
&lt;/colgroup&gt;
&lt;thead class= thead  style= text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom; &gt;
&lt;tr class= row &gt;
&lt;th class= entry row-nocellborder  style= text-align:left;vertical-align:top;  id= d110982e1734 &gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
Alarm Bit
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class= entry row-nocellborder  style= text-align:left;vertical-align:top;  id= d110982e1738 &gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
Alarm Cause
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class= entry cellrowborder  style= text-align:left;vertical-align:top;  id= d110982e1742 &gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
Effect
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody class= tbody  style= vertical-align:top; &gt;
&lt;tr class= row &gt;
&lt;td class= entry row-nocellborder  style= text-align:left;vertical-align:top;  headers= d110982e1734  &gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
0
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class= entry row-nocellborder  style= text-align:left;vertical-align:top;  headers= d110982e1738  &gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
The parameter &lt;span class= keyword parmname &gt;uiMinFreq&lt;/span&gt; is higher than the parameter &lt;span class= keyword parmname &gt;uiMaxFreq&lt;/span&gt;.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class= entry cellrowborder  rowspan= 4  style= text-align:left;vertical-align:top;  headers= d110982e1742  &gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
The compressor is stopped.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr class= row &gt;
&lt;td class= entry row-nocellborder  style= text-align:left;vertical-align:top;  headers= d110982e1734  &gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
1
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class= entry cellrowborder  style= text-align:left;vertical-align:top;  headers= d110982e1738  &gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
The parameter &lt;span class= keyword parmname &gt;iMinSetp&lt;/span&gt; is higher than 100.0 %.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr class= row &gt;
&lt;td class= entry row-nocellborder  style= text-align:left;vertical-align:top;  headers= d110982e1734  &gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
2
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class= entry cellrowborder  style= text-align:left;vertical-align:top;  headers= d110982e1738  &gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
The value of the input &lt;span class= keyword parmname &gt;usiMode&lt;/span&gt; is invalid.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr class= row &gt;
&lt;td class= entry row-nocellborder  style= text-align:left;vertical-align:top;  headers= d110982e1734  &gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
3
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class= entry cellrowborder  style= text-align:left;vertical-align:top;  headers= d110982e1738  &gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
&lt;span class= keyword parmname &gt;uiCompMgmtAlarmID&lt;/span&gt; input is not equal to 0.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr class= row &gt;
&lt;td class= entry row-nocellborder  style= text-align:left;vertical-align:top;  headers= d110982e1734  &gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
4-15
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class= entry row-nocellborder  style= text-align:left;vertical-align:top;  headers= d110982e1738  &gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
Reserved
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class= entry cellrowborder  style= text-align:left;vertical-align:top;  headers= d110982e1742  &gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
–
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class= section  id= D-SE-0046200__D-SE-0046200.6 &gt;
&lt;a name= D-SE-0046200.6  id= D-SE-0046200.6 &gt;
&lt;!-- --&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a name= D_SE_0046200_6  id= D_SE_0046200_6 &gt;
&lt;!-- --&gt;&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;h2 class= title sectiontitle &gt;
Troubleshooting
&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
In case of an alarm the compressor is stopped and the function block goes into alarm state. If the compressor goes into normal state, it is automatically restarted after the timers &lt;span class= keyword parmname &gt;uiMinCycleTime&lt;/span&gt; and &lt;span class= keyword parmname &gt;uiMinOffTime&lt;/span&gt; have elapsed:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class= tablenoborder &gt;
&lt;table cellpadding= 4  cellspacing= 0  summary=   class= table  width= 100%  frame= border  border= 1  rules= all  style= max-width: 100% ;height: auto; &gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style= width:20.19047619047619%  /&gt;
&lt;col style= width:34.285714285714285%  /&gt;
&lt;col style= width:45.52380952380952%  /&gt;
&lt;/colgroup&gt;
&lt;thead class= thead  style= text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom; &gt;
&lt;tr class= row &gt;
&lt;th class= entry row-nocellborder  style= text-align:left;vertical-align:top;  id= d110982e1855 &gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
Alarm
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class= entry row-nocellborder  style= text-align:left;vertical-align:top;  id= d110982e1859 &gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
Problem
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class= entry cellrowborder  style= text-align:left;vertical-align:top;  id= d110982e1863 &gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
Effect
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody class= tbody  style= vertical-align:top; &gt;
&lt;tr class= row &gt;
&lt;td class= entry row-nocellborder  style= text-align:left;vertical-align:top;  headers= d110982e1855  &gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
&lt;span class= keyword parmname &gt;uiAlarmID.0&lt;/span&gt; TRUE
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class= entry row-nocellborder  style= text-align:left;vertical-align:top;  headers= d110982e1859  &gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
Parameter &lt;span class= keyword parmname &gt;uiMinFreq&lt;/span&gt; is higher than the parameter &lt;span class= keyword parmname &gt;uiMaxFreq&lt;/span&gt;.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class= entry cellrowborder  rowspan= 3  style= text-align:left;vertical-align:top;  headers= d110982e1863  &gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
Check the parameter ranges.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
Set the value within the defined range.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr class= row &gt;
&lt;td class= entry row-nocellborder  style= text-align:left;vertical-align:top;  headers= d110982e1855  &gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
&lt;span class= keyword parmname &gt;uiAlarmID.1&lt;/span&gt; TRUE
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class= entry cellrowborder  style= text-align:left;vertical-align:top;  headers= d110982e1859  &gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
Parameter &lt;span class= keyword parmname &gt;iMinSetp&lt;/span&gt; is higher than 100.0 %.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr class= row &gt;
&lt;td class= entry row-nocellborder  style= text-align:left;vertical-align:top;  headers= d110982e1855  &gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
&lt;span class= keyword parmname &gt;uiAlarmID.2&lt;/span&gt; TRUE
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class= entry cellrowborder  style= text-align:left;vertical-align:top;  headers= d110982e1859  &gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
The value of the input &lt;span class= keyword parmname &gt;usiMode&lt;/span&gt; is invalid.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr class= row &gt;
&lt;td class= entry row-nocellborder  style= text-align:left;vertical-align:top;  headers= d110982e1855  &gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
&lt;span class= keyword parmname &gt;uiAlarmID.3&lt;/span&gt; TRUE
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class= entry row-nocellborder  style= text-align:left;vertical-align:top;  headers= d110982e1859  &gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
&lt;span class= keyword parmname &gt;uiCompMgmtAlarmID&lt;/span&gt; input is not equal to 0.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class= entry cellrowborder  style= text-align:left;vertical-align:top;  headers= d110982e1863  &gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
Verify the alarms of the function block &lt;span class= ph &gt;&lt;code class= ph codeph &gt;CompAlarmMgmt&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/span&gt;.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class= section  id= D-SE-0046200__D-SE-0046200.17 &gt;
&lt;a name= D-SE-0046200.17  id= D-SE-0046200.17 &gt;
&lt;!-- --&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a name= D_SE_0046200_17  id= D_SE_0046200_17 &gt;
&lt;!-- --&gt;&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;div class= note note &gt;
&lt;span class= notetitle &gt;NOTE:&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;ul class= sl simple &gt;
&lt;li class= sli &gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
You have to define the parameters of the data type specified in the table &lt;em class= ph i &gt;Non-Volatile Memory Variables&lt;/em&gt; in the non-volatile memory parameters in the application.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class= sli &gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
You have to use an &lt;code class= ph codeph &gt;ADR&lt;/code&gt; block to connect the following input pins to the variable defined in the non-volatile memory:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class= ul &gt;
&lt;li class= li &gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
&lt;code class= ph codeph &gt;ptrE2_OpHours&lt;/code&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class= li &gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
&lt;code class= ph codeph &gt;ptrE2_NbStarts&lt;/code&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class= sli &gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
If several instances of the function block are created inside the project, you have to create 8 new parameters in the non-volatile memory for each function block:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class= ul &gt;
&lt;li class= li &gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
&lt;code class= ph codeph &gt;E2_OpHours&lt;/code&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class= li &gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
&lt;code class= ph codeph &gt;E2_NbStarts&lt;/code&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class= note note &gt;
&lt;span class= notetitle &gt;NOTE:&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;ul class= sl simple &gt;
&lt;li class= sli &gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
You have to define the local or global variable of the data type specified in the table &lt;em class= ph i &gt;Array Variables&lt;/em&gt; with an array of 10 elements.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class= sli &gt;
&lt;p class= p &gt;
You have to use an ADR block to connect the input pin &lt;code class= ph codeph &gt;ptrArr_FreqLimits&lt;/code&gt; to the array variable.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;</descr>
						<vars>
							<inputVars>
								<var name="xEn" type="BOOL">
									<descr>Enables the function block</descr>
									<initValue>FALSE</initValue>
								</var>
								<var name="usiMode" type="USINT">
									<descr>Mode for compressor (1 to 3)</descr>
								</var>
								<var name="xCommand" type="BOOL">
									<descr>Start Command</descr>
									<initValue>FALSE</initValue>
								</var>
								<var name="xManualCommand" type="BOOL">
									<descr>Manual Start Cmd</descr>
								</var>
								<var name="xQuickStop" type="BOOL">
									<descr>Stop compressor forcing idle mode and skipping safety timers</descr>
								</var>
								<var name="iSetp" type="INT">
									<descr>Set Point for compressor (0 to 1000 *0.1%)</descr>
								</var>
								<var name="iManualSetp" type="INT">
									<descr>Manual setpoint (0 to 1000 *0.1%)</descr>
								</var>
								<var name="iMinSetp" type="INT">
									<descr>Minimum setpoint (0 to 1000 *0.1%)</descr>
								</var>
								<var name="uiCompMgmtAlarmID" type="UINT">
									<descr>Compressor Management Alarm ID</descr>
								</var>
								<var name="uiStartingTime" type="UINT">
									<descr>Duration of the starting Time (s)</descr>
								</var>
								<var name="uiStoppingTime" type="UINT">
									<descr>Duration of the stopping Time (s)</descr>
								</var>
								<var name="uiOilRecoveryTime" type="UINT">
									<descr>Delay time to switch to Oil Recovery mode (min)</descr>
								</var>
								<var name="uiOilRecoveryPeriod" type="UINT">
									<descr>Duration of the oil recovery period (s)</descr>
								</var>
								<var name="uiMinOnTime" type="UINT">
									<descr>Minimum run time of the compressor (s)</descr>
								</var>
								<var name="uiMinOffTime" type="UINT">
									<descr>Minimum off time of compressor (s)</descr>
								</var>
								<var name="uiMinCycleTime" type="UINT">
									<descr>Minimum Cycle time (s)</descr>
								</var>
								<var name="uiMinFreq" type="UINT">
									<descr>Minimum Frequency of compressor coreesponds to minimum set point (0 to 5000 *0.1 Hz)</descr>
								</var>
								<var name="uiMaxFreq" type="UINT">
									<descr>Maximumm Frequency of compressor coreesponds to maximum set point (0 to 5000 *0.1 Hz)</descr>
								</var>
								<var name="ptrArr_FreqLimits" type="@UINT">
									<descr>Pointer to give freq input in an array</descr>
									<initValue>0</initValue>
