					<functionBlock name="HPDefrostAndRevValve" version="1.0.1" creationDate="0" lastModifiedDate="1715096708">
						<title>Heat Pump Defrost and Reversing Valve</title>
						<descr>&lt;HTML&gt;The HPDefrostAndRevValve function implements reversing valve swap management during mode change and all typical phases for the defrost by cycle inversion of an air-water heat pump.&lt;br&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
In normal mode (usiDefrostStatus = 1), mode change is managed (from cooling mode to heating mode and vice versa).&lt;br&gt; 
&lt;br&gt;
If xCurrentMode changes its value from last time the swap procedure starts (usiDefrostStatus = 11), otherwise xRevValve = xCurrentMode.&lt;br&gt; 
&lt;br&gt;
◦ In usiDefrostStatus 11&lt;br&gt; 
Force xComprStop = TRUE and wait until xWorkingMode = FALSE; then go to usiDefrostStatus 12.&lt;br&gt; 
&lt;br&gt;
◦ In usiDefrostStatus 12:&lt;br&gt; 
Wait for uiCompValveTime seconds; then go to usiDefrostStatus 13.&lt;br&gt; 
&lt;br&gt;
◦ In usiDefrostStatus 13&lt;br&gt; 
Force xRevValve = xCurrentMode and wait for uiValveCompTime seconds; then return to usiDefrostStatus = 1.&lt;br&gt; 
&lt;br&gt;
If usiDefrostStatus = 1, to launch defrost, xCurrentMode must be TRUE (this input could be used to inform that machine is in heating mode).&lt;br&gt; 
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
Manual launch&lt;br&gt; 
&lt;br&gt; 
If ManualStart rises up from FALSE to TRUE, the input xDefrostEn is verified.&lt;br&gt; 
If TRUE, the defrost starts immediately with usiDefrostStatus = 3.&lt;br&gt; 
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
Automatic launch&lt;br&gt; 
&lt;br&gt; 
If iEnDefrostProbe (temperature or pressure) ≤iEnDefrostValue and xWorkingMode = TRUE, the defrost delay time is started. When this is greater than a defined period, defrost is launched (usiDefrostStatus = 2).&lt;br&gt; 
If iEnDefrostProbe is in error (-32768), only the time is taken into account.&lt;br&gt; 
This period is adjusted with a calculation depending on iEnDefrostProbe:&lt;br&gt; 
1. If iEnDefrostProbe is greater than iEnDefrostValue, automatic defrost is not enabled.&lt;br&gt; 
2. uiDelay1: period between 2 defrosts when iEnDefrostProbe is equal to iEnDefrostValue.&lt;br&gt; 
3. uiDelay2: period between 2 defrosts when iEnDefrostProbe is less than iMinDefrostValue.&lt;br&gt; 
4. If iEnDefrostProbe is between iMinDefrostValue and iEnDefrostValue:&lt;br&gt; 
&lt;t&gt;Period = uiDelay1- (uiDelay1- uiDelay2) / (iEnDefrostValue - iMinDefrostValue) * (iEnDefrostValue - iEnDefrostProbe).&lt;br&gt; 
If iEnDefrostProbe returns greater than iEnDefrostValue or xWorkingMode = FALSE, the defrost delay time count is stopped.&lt;br&gt; 
If defrost is launched (usiDefrostStatus ≥2) or if xCurrentMode = FALSE, or xEn = FALSE, the delay time count is reset.&lt;br&gt; 
After the defrost delay expiration (usiDefrostStatus = 2), the input xDefrostEn is evaluated, and if TRUE, the defrost starts with usiDefrostStatus = 3.&lt;br&gt;
Otherwise the functions wait for xDefrostEn to become TRUE. This is used to synchronize with other instances of this function block (that is, with multiple circuits).&lt;br&gt; 
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
Execution Phases of (usiDefrostStatus Values): &lt;br&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
1. Wait for period expiration or manual command.&lt;br&gt; 
2. Wait for external enable (useful to determine defrost priorities and timing with multiple circuits).&lt;br&gt; 
3. Compressors are stopped, xComprStop = TRUE. Wait until xWorkingMode = FALSE.&lt;br&gt;  
4. Wait uiCompValveTimeDefrost seconds.&lt;br&gt;
5. Turn valve in cooling mode (xRevValve = FALSE), reduce pump speed at minimum (xPumpMin = TRUE), energize the electrical heater on the water loop if present (xHeater = TRUE), then wait uiValveCompTimeDefrost seconds.&lt;br&gt; 
6. The minimum of capacity of the machine will start (xComprStop = FALSE, xCompMin = TRUE) and the fans will stay de-energized (xFanStop = TRUE). Wait until iDefrostEndProbe ≥ iDefrostEndValue or for maximum duration uiMaxDefrostTime minutes.  If iDefrostEndProbe is in error (-32768), only time is taken into account.&lt;br&gt;
7. Compressors are stopped (xComprStop = TRUE, xCompMin = FALSE) and electrical heater are de-energized (xHeater = FALSE). Wait until xWorkingMode = FALSE.&lt;br&gt; 
8. Wait uiCompValveTimeDefrost seconds.&lt;br&gt;
9. Turn valve in heating mode (xRevValve = TRUE) and wait uiValveCompTimeDefrost seconds.&lt;br&gt; 
10. Return to normal pump and fan speed (xFanStop = FALSE, xPumpMin = FALSE) and wait uiDrippingTime minutes. Then machine returns to usiDefrostStatus = 1.&lt;br&gt; 
&lt;br&gt;
NOTE: If xEn = FALSE, then usiDefrostStatus = 0. The outputs are set to 0 and timers are reset. &lt;br&gt;</descr>
						<vars>
							<inputVars>
								<var name="xEn" type="BOOL">
									<descr>Enables the function block</descr>
									<initValue>FALSE</initValue>
								</var>
								<var name="xCurrentMode" type="BOOL">
									<descr>Current mode (TRUE: heating, FALSE: cooling)</descr>
									<initValue>FALSE</initValue>
								</var>
								<var name="xDefrostEn" type="BOOL">
									<descr>Defrost enable (TRUE: enable, FALSE: disable)</descr>
									<initValue>FALSE</initValue>
								</var>
								<var name="xWorkingMode" type="BOOL">
									<descr>Working mode of compressors  (TRUE: comp. ON, FALSE: comp. OFF)</descr>
								</var>
								<var name="xManualStart" type="BOOL">
									<descr>Manual start</descr>
									<initValue>FALSE</initValue>
								</var>
								<var name="iEnDefrostProbe" type="INT">
									<descr>Enabling defrost probe (*0.1  °C/°F/bar/PSI)</descr>
								</var>
								<var name="iEnDefrostValue" type="INT">
									<descr>Enabling defrost value (*0.1 °C/°F/bar/PSI)</descr>
									<initValue>70</initValue>
								</var>
								<var name="uiDelay1" type="UINT">
									<descr>Delay between 2 defrosts (working time) when external temperature is below iAuthDefrostTemp (min)</descr>
								</var>
								<var name="iMinDefrostValue" type="INT">
									<descr>Minimum value to define the second delay (*0.1 °C/°F/bar/PSI)</descr>
								</var>
								<var name="uiDelay2" type="UINT">
									<descr>Second delay when the external temperature is below iMinDefrostTemp (min)</descr>
								</var>
								<var name="iEnDefrostResetValue" type="INT">
									<descr>Defrost timer reset value (*0.1 °C/°F/bar/PSI)</descr>
									<initValue>100</initValue>
								</var>
								<var name="iDefrostEndProbe" type="INT">
									<descr>End defrost probe (*0.1  °C/°F/bar/PSI)</descr>
								</var>
								<var name="iDefrostEndValue" type="INT">
									<descr>Defrost end value ( *0.1 °C/°F/bar/PSI)</descr>
								</var>
								<var name="uiMaxDefrostTime" type="UINT">
									<descr>Maximum defrost time (min)</descr>
								</var>
								<var name="uiMinDefrostTime" type="UINT">
									<descr>Minimum defrost time (min)</descr>
								</var>
								<var name="uiCompValveTime" type="UINT">
									<descr>Delay between compressors stopped and valve switch (s)</descr>
								</var>
								<var name="uiCompValveTimeDefrost" type="UINT">
									<descr>Delay between compressors stopped and valve switch during defrost(s)</descr>
								</var>
								<var name="uiValveCompTime" type="UINT">
									<descr>Delay between valve switch and compressors on (s)</descr>
								</var>
								<var name="uiValveCompTimeDefrost" type="UINT">
									<descr>Delay between valve switch and compressors on during defrost (s)</descr>
								</var>
								<var name="uiDrippingTime" type="UINT">
									<descr>Dripping time (min)</descr>
								</var>
							</inputVars>
							<outputVars>
								<var name="usiDefrostStatus" type="USINT">
									<descr>Defrost status (0:Dis., 1:Wait time, 2:Wait enable 3:Stop compr. 4:Wait valve 5:Swap 6:Defrost, 7:Stop compr., 8:Wait valve, 9:Swap 10:Drip., 11:Stop c. ch. mode, 12:Wait ch. mode, 13: Swap ch. mode)</descr>
								</var>
								<var name="uiTimerNextDefr" type="UINT">
									<descr>Timer before next defrost (min)</descr>
								</var>
								<var name="xComprStop" type="BOOL">
									<descr>Compressors stop request</descr>
								</var>
								<var name="xRevValve" type="BOOL">
									<descr>Reversing valve command</descr>
								</var>
								<var name="xPumpMin" type="BOOL">
									<descr>Minimum pump speed request</descr>
								</var>
								<var name="xCompMin" type="BOOL">
									<descr>Minimum compressors capacity request</descr>
								</var>
								<var name="xFanStop" type="BOOL">
									<descr>Fan stop request</descr>
								</var>
								<var name="xHeater" type="BOOL">
									<descr>Electrical Heater request</descr>
								</var>
								<var name="uiTimerDefrostPhase" type="UINT">
									<descr>Timer of current defrost phase (s/min)</descr>
								</var>
							</outputVars>
							<externalVars>
								<var name="sysTimer" type="UDINT"/>
							</externalVars>
							<localVars>
								<var name="l_xManualStartOld" type="BOOL">
									<descr>old Manual start value</descr>
								</var>
								<var name="sysTimer_Old" type="UDINT"/>
								<var name="l_xDefrostPhaseTimerQ" type="BOOL"/>
								<var name="l_xDefrostPhaseEn" type="BOOL"/>
								<var name="l_udiDefrostPhaseTimerPt" type="UDINT"/>
								<var name="l_udiDefrostPhaseTimerEt_Old" type="UDINT"/>
								<var name="l_udiDefrostPhaseTimerEt" type="UDINT"/>
								<var name="xCurrentModeOld" type="BOOL"/>
								<var name="l_udiDelayDefrostTimerPt" type="UDINT"/>
								<var name="l_xDelayDefrostEn" type="BOOL"/>
								<var name="l_udiDelayDefrostTimerEt" type="UDINT"/>
								<var name="l_xDelayDefrostTimerQ" type="BOOL"/>
								<var name="l_udiDelayDefrostTimerEt_Old" type="UDINT"/>
								<var name="l_xDelayDefrostReset" type="BOOL"/>
								<var name="NONAME" type="BOOL"/>
							</localVars>
							<localConsts>
								<const name="ST_DISABLE" type="USINT">
									<descr>Enum value 0</descr>
									<initValue>0</initValue>
								</const>
								<const name="ST_WAIT_TIME" type="USINT">
									<descr>Enum value 1</descr>
									<initValue>1</initValue>
								</const>
								<const name="ST_WAIT_ENABLE" type="USINT">
									<descr>Enum value 2</descr>
									<initValue>2</initValue>
								</const>
								<const name="ST_START_CP_STOP" type="USINT">
									<descr>Enum value 3</descr>
									<initValue>3</initValue>
								</const>
								<const name="ST_START_WAIT_VALVE" type="USINT">
									<descr>Enum value 4</descr>
									<initValue>4</initValue>
								</const>
								<const name="ST_START_SWAP_VALVE" type="USINT">
									<descr>Enum value 5</descr>
									<initValue>5</initValue>
								</const>
								<const name="ST_DEFROST" type="USINT">
									<descr>Enum value 6</descr>
									<initValue>6</initValue>
								</const>
								<const name="ST_STOP_CP_STOP" type="USINT">
									<descr>Enum value 7</descr>
									<initValue>7</initValue>
								</const>
								<const name="ST_STOP_WAIT_VALVE" type="USINT">
									<descr>Enum value 8</descr>
									<initValue>8</initValue>
								</const>
								<const name="ST_STOP_SWAP_VALVE" type="USINT">
									<descr>Enum value 9</descr>
									<initValue>9</initValue>
								</const>
								<const name="ST_DRIPPING" type="USINT">
									<descr>Enum value 10</descr>
									<initValue>10</initValue>
								</const>
								<const name="ST_CHMODE_CP_STOP" type="USINT">
									<descr>Enum value 11</descr>
									<initValue>11</initValue>
								</const>
								<const name="ST_CHMODE_WAIT_VALVE" type="USINT">
									<descr>Enum value 12</descr>
									<initValue>12</initValue>
								</const>
								<const name="ST_CHMODE_SWAP_VALVE" type="USINT">
									<descr>Enum value 13</descr>
									<initValue>13</initValue>
								</const>
							</localConsts>
						</vars>
						<iecDeclaration active="FALSE"/>
						<interfaces/>
						<methods/>
						<sourceCode type="ST" encoded="true">
							<![CDATA[ti0R9il1tJlcBRBX08lPbwtSaq8TbTcefWaqmhJJZi1J9YFwTJr0BnhVG8sXbCtSEqwzbncd
