				<functions>
					<function name="EBMuiLinConv" version="1.0.0" hidden="true" creationDate="0" lastModifiedDate="1625236872" excludeFromBuild="FALSE">
						<descr>Linear Unsigned Integer Converter

X1 is mapped to Y1
X2 is mapped to Y2
between X1 and X2 a linear conversion is applied.
If LIMITED input is TRUE the output is limited between Y1 and Y2

If X1=X2 the function becomes a step regardless to LIMITED input
if iValue=-32768 output is -32768</descr>
						<returnValue>UINT</returnValue>
						<vars>
							<inputVars>
								<var name="uiValue" type="UINT"/>
								<var name="uiX1" type="UINT"/>
								<var name="uiX2" type="UINT"/>
								<var name="uiY1" type="UINT"/>
								<var name="uiY2" type="UINT"/>
								<var name="LIMITED" type="BOOL">
									<descr>If TRUE out is saturated outside interval [x1,x2]</descr>
								</var>
							</inputVars>
							<localVars>
								<var name="Scaler_tmp" type="DINT"/>
								<var name="Ymin" type="DINT"/>
								<var name="Ymax" type="DINT"/>
							</localVars>
						</vars>
						<iecDeclaration active="FALSE"/>
						<sourceCode type="ST" encoded="true">
							<![CDATA[ti0R9il1tJlcBRBX08lPbwtSaq8TbTcefWaqmhJJbi5p9vFwlJ/MBMhX28iPb/NXKq6DbI8e
